WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.520
Ask for a preview to see the forecast page beside the chat.

2
00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:10.284
Choose Annotate, then click the button you want to change.

3
00:00:10.368 --> 00:00:16.728
Describe the change and add the note. The number on the page marks the exact button.

4
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:23.970
Send the note to the agent that opened the page. It gets your words along with the element you picked.

5
00:00:23.975 --> 00:00:30.335
Here the button turns green on reload. Close the preview to return to the conversation.
